sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013), Zubkov et al. (2015) & Watanabe & Costantini (2004) kidney ureteric bud GDNF-RET-Wnt11 Turing branching morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 92.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2 remediated) evaluation of `2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py` (92.1/100, up from 52.4/100 in Pass 1; +39.7 overall). The remediated script implements the Menshykau & Iber (2013) Schnakenberg-type GDNF-RET-Wnt11 receptor-ligand reaction-diffusion mechanism (homogeneous steady state R* = a + b, G* = b / (a + b)^2, flux cancellation f + g = a + b - R, Jacobian stability det(J_0) = (a + b)^2, and critical Turing wavelength lambda_c = 0.472569); solves the 1D Neumann ampulla cap IMEX PDE across normalized tip radii rho_tip = pi*R_tip/lambda_c to demonstrate exact mode selection (m = 1 elongation, m = 2 dichotomous bifurcation, m = 3 trichotomous trifurcation, and m = 4 supernumerary polydomain budding); couples a 2D self-avoiding ureteric tree to a 2D mesenchymal GDNF diffusion-consumption sink field across 4 experimental conditions (WT control, Gdnf+/- or PRR^(UB-/-) hypoplasia, Spry1-/- hyper-branching, and exogenous GDNF bead ectopic budding) plus a no-sink ablation control; segments the SHA-256-verified E12.5 mouse metanephros GFP ureteric bud specimen (`kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg`, detecting 12 WT tips in Panel A vs 6 hypoplastic mutant tips in Panel B, exact 2.00x ratio); and is backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_054_kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret.lean`. Overall 92.1/100 (faithfulness 91.4, reproducibility 93.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 89, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 565423 B, 1989×1333 px, artifact_sha256 cf7da6637fb2795539707f9f22da2ef029e38d523039bd51adc453c13f1027e9 (sha256 cf7da6637fb2795539707f9f22da2ef029e38d523039bd51adc453c13f1027e9), spec_fingerprint 98ff66f09006e3949d0b868aa475a2ba217b732f0d29cc82d9a5d3b4965aeb50. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 98ff66f09006e3949d0b868aa475a2ba217b732f0d29cc82d9a5d3b4965aeb50; artifact_sha256: cf7da6637fb2795539707f9f22da2ef029e38d523039bd51adc453c13f1027e9; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret_reference.json=89257794ab9d8d23..., datasets/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret/kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg=3264f509ba3a6686..., datasets/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret/paper_citations.bib=bb8e3d5a5c8877bd..., datasets/kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret/scout_manifest.json=c55304eda64bfba4...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-kidney-ureteric-bud-gdnf-ret-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple 3D phase-field or arbitrary Lagrangian-Eulerian (ALE) moving-boundary finite elements to resolve full 3D ampulla necking and orthogonal dihedral rotation across E13.5-E16.5 renal calyces.",
            "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit BMP7/Gremlin1 and FGF7 stromal mesenchymal feedback loops alongside GDNF-RET-Wnt11-Sprouty1." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.921"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Loop 054 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

